      {
        "children": [
          {
            "content": "This report analyzes the interrelationships between three critical financial indicators from February 2021 through December 2025: the Federal Funds Rate, inflation, and the NASDAQ Composite Index. The period examined encompasses one of the most volatile economic cycles in modern history, including the post-COVID recovery, historic inflation surge, aggressive Fed rate hikes, and subsequent market corrections and recoveries.",
