        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "items": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "content": "The Federal Funds Rate experienced dramatic swings, from historic lows of 0.07% to a peak of 5.33%",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "indent": 0
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "content": "Inflation surged from 129.90 to 148.50, reaching multi-decade highs",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "indent": 0
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "content": "The NASDAQ Composite showed extreme volatility, ranging from 10,213 to 23,958",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "indent": 0
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "content": "Strong negative correlation exists between Fed Funds Rate and NASDAQ performance during rate hike cycles",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "indent": 0
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "content": "Real interest rates remained deeply negative throughout most of the period, indicating inflation exceeded nominal rates",
